{
    "word": "carl",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "66cc6329-2fa8-325e-a176-aa8af3a59c49",
                "word": "Carl",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4ad9f763-7b26-47d7-8e92-a5ddb7f6ca90",
                        "entry_id": "66cc6329-2fa8-325e-a176-aa8af3a59c49",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Carls"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d482cf50-15e5-3281-9cd9-2e679d1cfa7b",
                        "entry_id": "66cc6329-2fa8-325e-a176-aa8af3a59c49",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male given name from the Germanic languages, equivalent to English Charles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ba77443-9083-48bc-ae3f-0bd050046c4f",
                                "sense_id": "d482cf50-15e5-3281-9cd9-2e679d1cfa7b",
                                "text": "Of course you know that Carl Duruside, or 'Doctor Carl', as he is always called by almost anybody, is my husband's brother?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff9b2335-3a75-47ef-9800-7b0f10705511",
                                "sense_id": "d482cf50-15e5-3281-9cd9-2e679d1cfa7b",
                                "text": "And Thomas Carlyle is nine. They call him Carl, and he has a regular mania for collecting toads and bugs and frogs and bringing them into the house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d493e06e-5ca6-4891-9c70-d09710428c80",
                                "sense_id": "d482cf50-15e5-3281-9cd9-2e679d1cfa7b",
                                "text": "I'd weave through the throng — scanning for empties to return while flirting, sniffing out kids smoking grass and sharing smokes with Ivor and Carl on the door. With a name like Carl you can imagine a six-foot tall and wide bouncer, but Ivor..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "289e87d4-ccc5-4d86-9ad5-9124643cc5ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "66cc6329-2fa8-325e-a176-aa8af3a59c49",
                        "source_sense_id": "d482cf50-15e5-3281-9cd9-2e679d1cfa7b",
                        "source_sense_description": "transliterations and equivalents of \"Carl\"",
                        "target_lang_word": "Карл",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Карл",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38abda8d-dd57-3b78-a977-2857a1287932",
                                        "entry_id": "7ca06008-3c3a-3f9a-8a87-3c1309459899",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "мужское имя"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf514f20-c4da-4599-8ab6-9951d19bdb1f",
                                                "sense_id": "38abda8d-dd57-3b78-a977-2857a1287932",
                                                "text": "Карл Генрих Маркс (нем. Karl Heinrich Marx; 5 мая 1818, Трир — 14 марта 1883, Лондон) — немецкий философ, социолог, экономист, писатель, поэт, политический журналист, общественный деятель."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2cfae85-6081-301b-ba48-830642310d7a",
                                        "entry_id": "7ca06008-3c3a-3f9a-8a87-3c1309459899",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "фамилия"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
